# Live deploy — app.regguardagent.com only

**Sole production URL:** https://app.regguardagent.com  
**Repo / deploy:** Vercel from `TonyPitaniello/regguard-live` `main`.

## Hard rules

- All live / production updates, verification, and user-facing links go to **app.regguardagent.com only**.
- Do **not** treat these as production or tell the user to check them for live:
  - `app.regguard.com` / `regguard.com` (parked / wrong)
  - `*.vercel.app` preview hostnames (internal only; never the “live” answer)
  - localhost / other staging hosts as the shipped destination
- When confirming a ship, curl/check **https://app.regguardagent.com** (BUILD id or change string). Say the live URL is app.regguardagent.com (add `?forceclear=1` when PWA/cache bust is needed).

## After each user-facing change batch

1. Commit relevant files (skip backend runtime dumps like `account_credits.json` / `*.jsonl` unless asked).
2. `git push origin HEAD` immediately — do not wait to be asked.
3. Bump frontend `RG_BUILD_ID` / `BUILD` when UI must defeat stale PWA/Arc caches.
4. Confirm the new BUILD (or change) is on **app.regguardagent.com**.
5. Tell the user that live URL only.

Do this after **each** change batch, not only at the end of the conversation.
